WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
c9n shows where people, knowledge and AI
work together in your company.

00:08.000 --> 00:17.000
People set goals and approve results.
AI roles prepare information and suggestions.

00:17.000 --> 00:26.000
The Second Brain connects departments through reviewed knowledge.
Access to sources is explicitly defined.

00:26.000 --> 00:38.000
An example: share a screenshot, extract information,
review it and save it as knowledge.

00:38.000 --> 00:47.000
Compare effort and quality before and after the change.
The numbers shown are sample data, not customer results.

00:47.000 --> 00:54.000
Optional GPU sharing and credits are planned.
Your internal installation remains independent.

00:54.000 --> 01:00.000
Design together. Review automation. Measure impact.
Start with one process at c9n.app.
